5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's make sure we don't just guess the fees this year. We need real data so we know exactly what we can count on. What do you all think we should check first?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Mio. A thoughtful approach is best. I think we should look into the attendance patterns to see how people are actually using the club before we decide on the costs.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm with Jonathan. We can't just set a flat fee if some people are here every day and others barely show up. We need to see who's actually using the club.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that data is essential. However, we should also consider the administrative effort required to manage the fees. We need to ensure the system is sustainable for whoever handles the books.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we should definitely keep it easy for new people to join too! Let's make sure we look at how people get started so nobody feels left out. What do you guys think?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That's a great point, Kenji! But to avoid guesswork, we really need to see the actual money flow. I suggest we split up the research so we cover finances, admin work, and attendance all at once.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That sounds like a very balanced plan, Mio. Dividing the tasks will allow us to be thorough without overwhelming any one person. I am happy to help gather the data on member attendance.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll take the lead on the attendance side too. I want to know exactly who is doing the heavy lifting and who is just coasting. Let's get the real numbers on the table.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we are dividing the research, I will focus on the administrative side. I want to understand the actual time commitment involved in managing the accounts to avoid overloading the next treasurer.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a plan! I'll help out by looking into how the new members are doing. I want to make sure we don't make it too scary for them to join!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Since we're splitting things up, I'll handle the financial side! I want to see exactly what we spent and what actually came in last year so we have a solid foundation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the tally of the sign-in sheets and the weekday turnout since the summer outings. I believe understanding the current rhythm of our attendance is key.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll check the rota against the attendance record and the outgoing treasurer's logged hours. I want to see who's actually working and who's just taking up space.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals. I want to see the actual time spent and the complexity of the payment process.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners! I want to see why some people decide to join and what might stop others.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Sounds like we've got it covered! I'll take the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals. Let's get to it so we can stop guessing!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am content with these choices. I will proceed with the sign-in sheets and the weekday turnout. I look forward to seeing what we all discover.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm set. I'll stick with the rota against the attendance record and the treasurer's hours. Let's find out the truth about who's actually contributing. See you all soon.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals. I believe these will reveal the true cost of administration. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set too! I'll dive into the mid-year sign-ups and the taster forms. I can't wait to see what we find out! See you guys later!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
